(b) under Patent Claims of such Contributor to make, use, sell, offer for 
    sale, have made, import, export, use, assign, exercise, practice, 
    and/or otherwise exploit its Contributions, either on an unmodified 
    basis, with Modifications, or as part of a Larger Work; and

(c) under the rights of such Contributor to make, use, and/or otherwise 
    exploit its Contributions, in all or in part, in order to author, 
    develop, promote, or deploy a Modified Version of the Covered 
    Software, or to make, use, and/or otherwise exploit a Larger Work 
    that is produced by combining the Covered Software with a Separate 
    Work of the Contributor.

The grants set forth in subsection 2.1(a) and (b) are effective on the 
later of the dates noted in Exhibit A, or at the time the Contributions 
granted herein are received by You.

2.2. Effective Date

The grants set forth in Section 2.1 with respect to any Contribution 
shall be effective as of the date following the dates first noted in 
Exhibit A.

