    same non-discriminatory, royalty-free basis as the Covered Software, 
    for at least as long as You distribute or provide access to the 
    Covered Software.

    You must also include, on each user interface that You use to 
    interact with users (if any), a prominently displayed notice that 
    this Covered Software is licensed under this License, with a 
    hyperlink to the License text.

    If You create or distribute Modified Versions or Larger Works, You 
    must retain all copyright, patent, trademark, and attribution notices 
    that are present in the Covered Software, and must describe any 
    changes You make to Covered Software in the Source Code Form.

    You must cause any Covered Software that You distribute or make 
    available in Executable Form or Source Code Form to carry prominent 
    notices indicating that You have modified the Covered Software.

(f) Description of Source Code Form.
    The Source Code Form of Covered Software must include all parts of 
    the source code for the Covered Software, and must be accompanied by 
    the Documentation, if any, or the corresponding source code for the 
    Documentation, in a reasonable manner, as determined by the initial 
